{"id":63584,"date":"2026-08-25T18:54:27","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T17:54:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63584"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:46:42","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:46:42","slug":"tryka-grand-finale","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tryka-grand-finale\/","title":{"rendered":"Tryka Grand Finale 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Tryka Grand Finale 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Tryka Grand Finale 2026<\/strong> realiza-se a <strong>10 de outubro de 2026<\/strong> nos pavilh\u00f5es de topo da <strong>FIL \u2013 Feira Internacional de Lisboa<\/strong>, no Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es, em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Como grande evento de encerramento da temporada internacional da liga TRYKA, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o desafia atletas de todos os n\u00edveis numa combina\u00e7\u00e3o de corrida intervalada e 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais intensas: SkiErg (1000m), Kettlebell Farmers Carry (200m), RamThrusters (60 reps), Sled Push (50m), Sled Pull (50m), Rowing (1000m), Walking Lunges (100m), Burpee Broad Jumps (80m) e sprint final de 40 metros.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa divide-se nos formatos <strong>TRYKA 800<\/strong> (8 voltas de 800m de corrida intercaladas com as esta\u00e7\u00f5es) e <strong>TRYKA 500<\/strong> (8 voltas de 500m, ideal para estreantes e ritmo veloz), com categorias individuais Singles (Open e Pro), duplas Doubles e equipas Relay. A participa\u00e7\u00e3o inclui cronometragem de precis\u00e3o eletr\u00f3nica por chip pela Mika Timing, abastecimentos, patch oficial de finalista, p\u00f3dios e trof\u00e9us da \u00e9poca.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">FIL &#8211; Feira Internacional de Lisboa, Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">TRYKA 800 (8x 800m + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es), TRYKA 500 (8x 500m + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">TRYKA<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/tryka.fit\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Tryka-Official-Rules-Movement-Standards-.docx-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TRYKA 800 (Open, Pro &#038; Doubles)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Desde 65.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TRYKA 500 (Open &#038; Doubles)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Desde 55.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TRYKA Relay (Men, Women, Mixed)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Desde 120.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Tryka Grand Finale 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento tem lugar no s\u00e1bado, 10 de outubro de 2026, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da FIL \u2013 Feira Internacional de Lisboa, no Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es, Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a diferen\u00e7a entre o TRYKA 800 e o TRYKA 500?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ambos cumprem as 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais id\u00eanticas; contudo, no TRYKA 800 os segmentos de corrida entre esta\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00eam 800 metros cada (total de 6,4 km de corrida), enquanto no TRYKA 500 t\u00eam 500 metros (total de 4 km de corrida), sendo mais acess\u00edvel a estreantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de exerc\u00edcio obrigat\u00f3rias?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As esta\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o: 1. SkiErg (1000m), 2. Kettlebell Farmers Carry (200m), 3. RamThrusters (60 reps), 4. Sled Push (50m), 5. Sled Pull (50m), 6. Rower (1000m), 7. Walking Lunges (100m) e 8. Burpee Broad Jumps (80m), terminando com um sprint de 40m para a meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio qualificar-se previamente para a Grand Finale?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">N\u00e3o. O evento est\u00e1 aberto \u00e0 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o direta de atletas individuais, duplas, gin\u00e1sios afiliados e empresas sem necessidade de \u00edndice m\u00ednimo pr\u00e9vio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar as regras e garantir o meu bilhete oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento t\u00e9cnico de movimentos em PDF e os bilhetes de participa\u00e7\u00e3o oficiais est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o em tryka.fit.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Tryka Grand Finale 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"FIL - Feira Internacional de Lisboa (Lisboa)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"FIL - Feira Internacional de Lisboa (Lisboa)\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Tryka Grand Finale 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento tem lugar no s\u00e1bado, 10 de outubro de 2026, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da FIL \u2013 Feira Internacional de Lisboa, no Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es, Lisboa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a diferen\u00e7a entre o TRYKA 800 e o TRYKA 500?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ambos cumprem as 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais id\u00eanticas; contudo, no TRYKA 800 os segmentos de corrida entre esta\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00eam 800 metros cada (total de 6,4 km de corrida), enquanto no TRYKA 500 t\u00eam 500 metros (total de 4 km de corrida), sendo mais acess\u00edvel a estreantes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de exerc\u00edcio obrigat\u00f3rias?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As esta\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o: 1. SkiErg (1000m), 2. Kettlebell Farmers Carry (200m), 3. RamThrusters (60 reps), 4. Sled Push (50m), 5. Sled Pull (50m), 6. Rower (1000m), 7. Walking Lunges (100m) e 8. Burpee Broad Jumps (80m), terminando com um sprint de 40m para a meta.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio qualificar-se previamente para a Grand Finale?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"N\u00e3o. O evento est\u00e1 aberto \u00e0 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o direta de atletas individuais, duplas, gin\u00e1sios afiliados e empresas sem necessidade de \u00edndice m\u00ednimo pr\u00e9vio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as regras e garantir o meu bilhete oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento t\u00e9cnico de movimentos em PDF e os bilhetes de participa\u00e7\u00e3o oficiais est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o em tryka.fit.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68127,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[478,1455,519],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63584","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-hyrox","event_type-obstaculos","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-tryka-grand-finale.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63584","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\